    <amendment date="2026-07-22" by="orchestrator (Phase-2 coverage-gate finding)">
      SCOPE EXTENSION — client half. In addition to the SERVER structural ops in the Patch Engine, this task
      MUST wire the CLIENT structural-step→operation emission: the task-020 interceptor's `onStructuralStep`
      seam (currently unwired) must emit `splitParagraph`/`mergeParagraph`/`insertParagraph`/`deleteParagraph`
      operations (per the task-003 schema) into the rebased op-log, so whole-paragraph delete/merge is captured
      client-side. This closes the coverage gap that blocked task 023 (see `notes/task-023-coverage-gap.md`);
      task 023 (delete `collectEditedParagraphs`) now depends on this task landing.
    </amendment>
