    <constraint source="ADR-038 / NFR-06">Structural-op round-trip proof lands in the task 034 seam slices; unit-green ≠ done. NO `Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt;`, DI-registration, or ctor-null tests.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <topic>OOXML structural edits (paragraph split/merge/insert/delete); paragraph-mark deletion via `w:pPr/w:rPr/w:del`; applier ordering discipline; BFF hygiene</topic>
    <files>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-007-spefilestore.md</file>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-010-di-minimalism.md</file>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-013-ai-architecture.md</file>
